author: pi-agent
severity: high
repro_steps: echo ready && NPM=npm followed by $NPM publish can leave the command word unresolved and omitted.
resolution: Reject unresolved scalar command expressions followed by the literal publish subcommand while preserving conservative unknown-status state.
expected_result: An unresolved scalar command word is an explicit audit failure.
actual_result: Only unresolved indexed-array command words currently fail closed.
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-30T18:43:55.483Z",pi-agent,"Greptile 3890193848 reproduced: with only verifier source reverted, the focused attested-sibling regression returned zero failures; SOURCE_ONLY_REVERT_EXIT=1. Rather than assuming arbitrary commands succeed and risking false provenance, the restored verifier fails closed when an unresolved scalar occupies command position before a literal publish subcommand. npm test, 100% coverage, docstring, release:check, and the real workflow attestation verifier pass."
